  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE 2025 - X Solar Systems ApS - Financing of solar for female led SMEs in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to launch new initiative dedicated to financing captive solar solutions for female owned and female led SMEs in Kenya. The initiative addresses the dual challenge of lack of access to reliable energy and to affordable financing, especially for women. Initiative aims to provide tailored solar financing. Project aims to test the market for such an initiative as a permanent offering for female owned and female led SMEs in Kenya. The aim is to conduct 1-3 pilot projects as part of the project and feasibility study stage.</narrative>
  </description>
